<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Error - Something Went Wrong</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        .error-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .error-icon {
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: #dc3545;
        }
        .error-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #343a40;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .error-message {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #6c757d;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .btn-refresh {
            background-color: #007bff;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
            font-size: 1rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn-refresh:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }
        .footer-text {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #6c757d;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-icon">⚠️</div>
        <h1 class="error-title">Oops! Something Went Wrong</h1>
        <p class="error-message">We are currently experiencing some technical issues. Please try again later or contact our support team if the problem persists.</p>
        <button class="btn btn-refresh" onclick="window.location.reload()">Try Again</button>
        <p class="footer-text">
        Need help?
        <a href="mailto:support@digitalden.com" class="text-primary">Contact Support</a>
        </p>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>